    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d93">

                <pb facs="0121" n="112" xml:id="pg112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/1313: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-20T19:00:00-05:00">April 20, 1938—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>51. For Braden. Your 93, April 19, 3 p.m. The Department approves of your
                    remaining in Buenos Aires until the termination of the present phase of the
                    negotiations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
